{"about_the_game":"<strong>Story</strong><br><br>Space of Darkness tells the story of a mechanic who works on a space station. The mechanic is alone on the ship for a few months. One day the power suddenly cuts off. He soon finds himself alone in the dark corridors of a space station. Can you unearth what truly happened on the space station? Are you able to find the small Space Ship and help the partner crew?<br><br><br><strong>About</strong><br><br>you are a mechanic who wants to find out what happened on the space station, it will be a little adventure that awaits him a space station full of unexpected surprises, explore, make quests, collect stuff and survive!<br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Low-Poly Graphics<br></li><li> Jump-Scares<br></li><li> Loot<br></li><li> Letters<br></li><li> Enemys<br></li><li>Hotbar<br></li><li> Flashlight System<br></li><li> Achievements<br></li><li> and more!</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"38a9d2b7ef9f82f3d6aef4a7e777723a7b221856.jpg","localized_name":"First Start","name":"First Start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/666310/38a9d2b7ef9f82f3d6aef4a7e777723a7b221856.jpg"},{"icon":"b43e0f0fb954daacadb1cacf4b72a6042283af31.jpg","localized_name":"FlashLight!","name":"FlashLight!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/666310/b43e0f0fb954daacadb1cacf4b72a6042283af31.jpg"},{"icon":"cd5d633943a0b42bcd520dcabf65e1cd574864d1.jpg","localized_name":"RadioCheck!","name":"RadioCheck!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/666310/cd5d633943a0b42bcd520dcabf65e1cd574864d1.jpg"},{"icon":"4dfad4992f64647cb9369840c1587e800be2c1f5.jpg","localized_name":"Axe!","name":"Axe!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/666310/4dfad4992f64647cb9369840c1587e800be2c1f5.jpg"},{"icon":"da97e7140098750f46a731cc3a0fb3b9a5eba8a6.jpg","localized_name":"OhMySod!","name":"OhMySod!","path":"htt